    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;perf(login): batch dashboard data in login response, optimize stats query

- New getInitialDashboardData() helper pre-fetches logs (10) + chunks (10)
- All 4 auth endpoints (login, register, google/dummy, google/real) include dashboard in response
- Frontend pre-populates TanStack Query cache from login response via setQueryData
- Stats query: SELECT only needed columns (no audio_base64), single-pass Map-based date indexing
- Eliminates 2 extra round trips on login — dashboard data arrives with auth response

Co-Authored-By: Claude &amp;lt;noreply@anthropic.com&amp;gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
